        "分离变量",
        "用初值确定常数"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "substitution_ivp",
        "template": "形如 $y' = f(x+y)$ 的初值问题",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "特解",
          "steps": [
            "令 $u = x + y$，则 $\\frac{du}{dx} = 1 + \\frac{dy}{dx} = 1 + u^2$",
            "分离变量：$\\frac{du}{1+u^2} = dx$",
            "$\\arctan u = x + C$",
            "$u = \\tan(x + C)$",
            "$y = \\tan(x+C) - x$",
            "初值条件 $y(0) = 0$：$0 = \\tan C$，得 $C = 0$",
            "**答：$y = \\tan x - x$**"
          ]
        }
      ],
