      "math_structure": {
        "type": "logistic_equation",
        "template": "Logistic增长模型 $y' = ry(1-\\frac{y}{K})$",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "通解",
          "steps": [
            "$\\frac{dy}{2y(1-y)} = dx$",
            "部分分式：$\\frac{1}{y(1-y)} = \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{1-y}$",
            "$\\int \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{1-y})dy = \\int dx$",
            "$\\frac{1}{2}(\\ln|y| - \\ln|1-y|) = x + C$",
            "$\\ln\\left|\\frac{y}{1-y}\\right| = 2x + 2C$",
            "$\\frac{y}{1-y} = Ke^{2x}$（$K = \\pm e^{2C}$）",
            "$y = (1-y)Ke^{2x}$",
            "$y(1 + Ke^{2x}) = Ke^{2x}$",
            "$y = \\frac{Ke^{2x}}{1+Ke^{2x}}$",
            "**答：$y = \\frac{Ke^{2x}}{1+Ke^{2x}}$；特殊解 $y \\equiv 0$，$y \\equiv 1$**"
          ]
        }
